-- 0055_daily_anagram_words.sql
-- Answer words for Daily Anagram ("Letter Shuffle"): 1,412 common 7 to 9 letter English words.
-- Built from SCOWL's most common word bands (notice kept in seed/daily-puzzle/NOTICE-SCOWL.txt).
-- Each word has no other anagram in a large English word list, so "only the intended answer counts"
-- is fair. Plain plurals, -ed/-ing/-ly/-er/-est forms, flagged and sensitive words are left out.
-- Regenerate with seed/daily-anagram/generate-anagram-answers.mjs. Reviewed by Dani/Rika before loading.
-- Safe to run twice (on conflict do nothing).

